好嘞，冇問題！以下係用「睇怕」造嘅10句廣東話例句，附帶英文翻譯：

1.  睇怕今晚落大雨，記得帶遮。 (I think it's going to rain heavily tonight, remember to bring an umbrella.)
2.  佢咁樣講嘢，睇怕佢唔係真心想幫我。 (The way he's talking, I don't think he genuinely wants to help me.)
3.  睇怕呢個計劃唔會成功，因為經費唔夠。 (I'm afraid this plan won't succeed because there isn't enough funding.)
4.  睇怕佢唔會嚟，佢之前已經講過好忙。 (I doubt he'll come, he said he was very busy before.)
5.  睇怕呢間餐廳啲嘢食唔好味，啲人成日都話唔掂。 (I think the food at this restaurant isn't very good, people always say it's not up to par.)
6.  睇怕佢唔知發生咗咩事，佢成日都唔睇新聞。 (I think he doesn't know what's going on, he rarely watches the news.)
7.  睇怕我今次考試考唔好，我冇好好準備。 (I'm afraid I won't do well on this exam, I didn't prepare well.)
8.  睇怕呢部電腦壞咗喇，開唔到機。 (I think this computer is broken, it won't turn on.)
9.  睇怕佢唔會同意我嘅建議，佢成日都唔聽人講。 (I doubt he'll agree with my suggestion, he rarely listens to others.)
10. 睇怕呢個情況會持續落去，我哋要諗辦法解決。 (I think this situation will continue, we need to find a way to resolve it.)
 [end of text]


